### Revisit the optimization problem

+ consider a general function $f: \mathbb{R}^n \to \mathbb{R}$ and a constraint $g_j: \mathbb{R}^n \to \mathbb{R}, j=1, \dots,m$

+ the Lagrangian is $L(x, \lambda) = f(x) - \sum_{j=1}^m \lambda_j g_j(x)$

+ the bordered Hessian matrix is

::: {.fragment}

$$
\begin{bmatrix} 0 & \cdots & 0 & \frac{\partial g_1(\cdot)}{\partial x_1} &  \cdots & \frac{\partial g_1(\cdot)}{\partial x_n}\\ \vdots & \ddots & \vdots & \vdots & \ddots & \vdots \\
0 & \cdots & 0 & \frac{\partial g_m(\cdot)}{\partial x_1} &  \cdots & \frac{\partial g_m(\cdot)}{\partial x_n} \\
\frac{\partial g_1(\cdot)}{\partial x_1} &  \cdots & \frac{\partial g_m(\cdot)}{\partial x_1} & \frac{\partial^2 L(\cdot)}{\partial x_1^2} &  \cdots & \frac{\partial^2 L(\cdot)}{\partial x_1 \partial x_n} \\
\vdots & \ddots & \vdots & \vdots & \ddots & \vdots \\
\frac{\partial g_1(\cdot)}{\partial x_n} &  \cdots & \frac{\partial g_m(\cdot)}{\partial x_n} & \frac{\partial^2 L(\cdot)}{\partial x_n \partial x_1} &  \cdots & \frac{\partial^2 L(\cdot)}{\partial x_n^2} \\
\end{bmatrix}
$$

:::

## Applications in Calculus {visibility="hidden"}
### Revisit the optimization problem

+ Let $(x^*, \lambda^*)$ solve the FOC of the Lagrangian, then 
    + $X^*$ is a local minimizer if the bordered Hessian matrix is positive definite
        + $|\bar{H}_{2m}|$ and all the leading principal minors have the same sign as $(-1)^m$
    + $X^*$ is a local maximizer if the bordered Hessian matrix is negative definite
        + $|\bar{H}_{2m}|$ has the same sign as $(-1)^m$ and the leading principal minors alternate in sign thereafter

::: {.notes}

+ The first $m$ leading principle minors are zero matrices (every element of the matrix, $|\bar{H}_1|$ through $|\bar{H}_m|$ is zero)
• The next $m − 1$ leading principle minors will have a determinant of zero (every element of the matrix, $|\bar{H}_{m+1}|$ through $|\bar{H}_{2m-1}|$ is zero)

+ For example:
    + 0 Borders: −; +; −; + : : : (max) or +; +; +; +; : : : (min)
    + 1 Border: +; −; +; −; : : : (max) or −; −; −; −; : : : (min)
    + 2 Borders: −; +; −; +; : : : (max) or +; +; +; +; : : : (min)

:::


